## usage
```go
import "github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-go/sdk/azcore/cloud"

// the cloud package has predefined configuration for public clouds
conf := cloud.AzureChina

// users can create configuration for private clouds
conf = cloud.Configuration{LoginEndpoint: "..."}

// Clients default to Azure Public Cloud. An azcore.ClientOptions field overrides the default.
clientOpts := azcore.ClientOptions{Cloud: conf}

// client option types already embed azcore.ClientOptions, creating a consistent API for cloud configuration:
cred, err := azidentity.NewDefaultAzureCredential(
    &azidentity.DefaultAzureCredentialOptions{ClientOptions: clientOpts}
)
handle(err)

client, err := armsubscription.NewClient(
    cred, &arm.ClientOptions{ClientOptions: clientOpts}
)
handle(err)
```

